        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1Nk1tNXBObFpIVEhkdWRVeEtiV2hCYWxCSVltYxAB!2m1!1s0x340401002294e423:0x91f37944188f250a"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJI-SUIgABBDQRCiWPGER585E/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4emVsTnlRa0ZDT0RZeU0xa3hPSHAwWjFwVE1FRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "感覺就像踏入了另一個世界。招牌雞尾酒美味可口，而且出乎意料地容易上手。價格確實不菲，但我認為物有所值，因為這裡的氛圍、音樂、舒適的座椅以及整體環境都無可挑剔。很高興在香港發現了這麼棒的酒吧。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "It feels like stepping into another world. The signature cocktails are delicious and surprisingly easy to drink. It’s definitely expensive, but I think the price reflects the entire experience: the atmosphere, music, comfortable chairs, and overall ambiance. I’m glad I found such a great bar in Hong Kong.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Kobuta U",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100539691657198182200/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUH-d8cPKt1mxqNnqo4iMFsiHoRaWj1krPzV_P46FUuzbnhdm25NA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-08-17T22:48:54.177782289Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4emVsTnlRa0ZDT0RZeU0xa3hPSHAwWjFwVE1FRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4emVsTnlRa0ZDT0RZeU0xa3hPSHAwWjFwVE1FRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401002294e423:0x91f37944188f250a"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJI-SUIgABBDQRCiWPGER585E/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsT1FuTkVUV2w2ZG1KaWNGZHlUVTh6VVVWaFJtYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "如果可以打零星，我一定會給零星——\n\n一位男服務生一進門就讓我們出去，連問個簡單的問題都不肯。另一位服務員後來也出來了，態度同樣傲慢，讓我們無緣無故地站在一旁，拒絕解釋等候時間——儘管外面根本沒有其他人。\n\n更糟的是他們的傲慢。在香港工作，靠亞洲顧客賺錢，卻擺出一副高人一等的姿態，實在令人費解。服務人員不必熱情友好，但基本的尊重和專業不應該是可有可無的。\n\n人們記住一個地方，不是因為酒水，而是因為他們受到了怎樣的對待。不幸的是，這家店糟糕的服務讓人難以忘懷。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "If there is a zero star I would give zero -\n\nOne of the male staff members immediately told us to get outside instead of letting us ask a simple question at the entrance. Another came out later with an equally dismissive attitude, making us stand aside for no reason while refusing to explain the wait time — despite there being nobody else outside.\n\nWhat made the experience worse was the arrogance. Acting superior while working in Hong Kong and making money from Asian customers is a strange choice. Hospitality staff don’t need to be friendly, but basic respect and professionalism should not be optional.\n\nPeople don’t remember a venue for its drinks — they remember how they were treated. Unfortunately, this place made that part unforgettable for all the wrong reasons.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Rae Zhao",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109687313329101109579/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLE8YvBY0ncrXgYF8Te2V10sKKqoOfCHyuHXXNQyjv56Ge-Mg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
